WEBVTT

00:17:59.116 --> 00:18:00.867
not as opponents

00:18:00.909 --> 00:18:03.286
but as creative partners.

00:18:03.328 --> 00:18:06.998
And then together,
we rebuild this troubled world.

00:18:07.374 --> 00:18:09.334
Together, we reconnect.

00:18:09.334 --> 00:18:12.587
Together, we earn the respect of history

00:18:12.629 --> 00:18:17.926
and transform this chaos
into a beautiful cosmos.

00:18:17.926 --> 00:18:19.427
Thank you for listening to me.

00:18:19.469 --> 00:18:26.226
(Applause)